type: image
style: photography / flat lay
aspect: 16:9
resolution: 2048x1152

prompt: |
  Overhead flat-lay photograph of a creative maker's workbench.
  Cork board background covered with pinned items: sticky notes in yellow, blue, pink, and green.
  Pieces of masking tape holding down sketches and printed diagrams.
  A small brass robot figurine sits among the supplies, holding a tiny pencil.
  Scattered supplies: colored markers, pencil shavings, binder clips, a ruler, scissors.
  Polaroid-style photos pinned with red and blue pushpins showing circuit boards and code screens.
  Hand-drawn flowcharts on graph paper. A coffee ring stain on one paper.
  Warm natural lighting from upper left. Shallow depth of field.
  Color palette: cork brown (#c4a574), sticky yellow (#fef3b5), marker blue (#2980b9), red (#e74c3c).
  Mood: creative chaos, organized mess, a brilliant mind at work.

usage: Hero banner for the Workbench theme — full-width background behind landing page content.
